note: batch 11b (R70.2-1): `use b as c; pub use c::Block;` and a private `a::Block` whose fields change: the effective visibility of the compiler says that no different crate can use the fields, so no line "the public API can change" (before: the name rule of the text, since R68.4-1 did not follow a name that a `use` line brings)
rule+: R70.2-1
